# Hash-locked slow-vs-fast comparison environment (Phase 7.3b WP1). Opt-in: install it
# explicitly with install.sh; Gradle never installs or imports it, and root check never
# needs it (only the lock's shared pins are compared, by verifyImageOracleDependencyPins).
# Pillow/NumPy/Transformers must stay in agreement with ../requirements.lock and
# tools/hf-reference/requirements.lock (verifyImageOracleDependencyPins fails a build
# if the locks ever disagree on those three packages or their environment markers).
# Torch/torchvision are the reviewed comparison runtime; they never enter the
# slow-reference locks.
torch==2.6.0+cpu ; sys_platform != "darwin"
torch==2.6.0 ; sys_platform == "darwin"
torchvision==0.21.0
transformers==4.57.6
Pillow==12.3.0
numpy==2.5.3
